<refentryinfo>
<title
>دليل مستخدم kdesrc-build</title>
<author
><personname
><firstname
>Michael</firstname
><surname
>Pyne</surname
></personname
> <email
>mpyne@kde.org</email
> <personblurb
><para
>Authored man page</para
></personblurb
